    "body": "Indeed. so [39 PRs since April 2020](https://github.com/whatwg/compat/pulls?q=is%3Apr+created%3A%3E2020-04-01)\r\n\r\nOn the 39 PRs\r\n\r\n* [6 Editorial ](https://github.com/whatwg/compat/pulls?q=is%3Apr+created%3A%3E2020-04-01+Editorial+in%3Atitle)\r\n* [5 Review Draft](https://github.com/whatwg/compat/pulls?q=is%3Apr+created%3A%3E2020-04-01+Review+in%3Atitle+)\r\n\r\n\r\nI can see only \r\n\r\n* #196\r\n* #185 \r\n\r\nAll the rest is editorial in nature or about the user agent strings section of the compat spec. \r\nSo that's only 2. The #196 was a modification of something which was already in the compat spec but just simplified, and you raised the issue about missing tests. Thanks!\r\nAnd for #185, not sure there's a test for this. Editorial nature?\r\n\r\n",
